---
export const prerender = true;

import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { agent } from '../data/agent';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Independent property marketing website"
  description="The terms on which this independent property marketing website is made available, including intellectual property, acceptable use and limitation of liability."
  pathname="/terms"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  intro="The terms on which this website is made available to you."
>
  <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing or using this website you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please
    do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Who operates this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by {agent.fullName}, CEA registration {agent.ceaRegistrationNumber}, of
    {' '}{agent.agencyName}, estate agency licence {agent.agencyLicenceNumber}.
    {' '}{site.legal.independentDisclosureFull}
  </p>

  <h2>3. Nature of the information</h2>
  <p>
    The content on this website is provided for general information only. It is not an offer, an
    invitation to treat, a representation or a warranty, and it does not form part of any contract.
    Project particulars, prices, unit availability, floor areas, plans, specifications and
    completion dates are indicative and subject to change without notice. The developer’s official
    documents and the Sale and Purchase Agreement prevail over anything shown here.
  </p>
  <p>See the <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> for the full position.</p>

  <h2>4. No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website is financial, investment, tax or legal advice. Property values can fall
    as well as rise. Before committing to a purchase you should obtain independent professional
    advice appropriate to your circumstances, and satisfy yourself as to financing, stamp duties and
    any obligations arising from property you already own.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the website for any unlawful purpose or in breach of these terms.</li>
    <li>
      Submit false, misleading or third-party contact details, or submit an enquiry on someone
      else’s behalf without their knowledge.
    </li>
    <li>
      Attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website or any connected system, or interfere with
      its operation.
    </li>
    <li>
      Use automated means to scrape, harvest or bulk-download content, or to submit enquiries.
    </li>
    <li>
      Reproduce, republish or distribute content from this website for commercial purposes without
      written permission.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    Original text, layout and design on this website belong to the website operator. Project names,
    logos, renders, plans, brochures and other developer materials belong to their respective owners
    and are used, where they appear, for identification and marketing of the development. No claim
    of ownership over third-party materials is made, and no endorsement or affiliation is implied.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you own material that appears here and wish it removed or corrected, contact {agent.email} and
    it will be dealt with promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>7. External links</h2>
  <p>
    This website may link to third-party sites, including mapping services, regulator registers and
    messaging services. Those sites are not under the operator’s control, and no responsibility is
    accepted for their content, availability or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Availability</h2>
  <p>
    The website is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. No warranty is given that it
    will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components, or that any defect will be
    corrected.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the maximum extent permitted by law, the website operator is not liable for any indirect,
    incidental, special or consequential loss, or for loss of profit, opportunity or data, arising
    from your use of, or reliance on, this website. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits
    liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited, including liability for fraud or for
    death or personal injury caused by negligence.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Enquiries and communications</h2>
  <p>
    Submitting an enquiry does not create any agency relationship, obligation to transact, or
    reserve any unit. Contact details you provide are handled as described in the
    {' '}<a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Changes</h2>
  <p>
    These terms may be updated at any time. The version published here at the time you use the
    website is the version that applies. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last
    revised.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore, and the courts of Singapore have exclusive
    jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {agent.fullName}, CEA registration {agent.ceaRegistrationNumber}, {agent.agencyName}, estate
    agency licence {agent.agencyLicenceNumber}. Email {agent.email}. Mobile {agent.mobileDisplay}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
